## Intent

Bài giảng điện tử "{{TITLE}}" cho học viên ABM, bằng tiếng Việt đơn giản, dễ hiểu cho người mới bắt đầu.

## Customizations (skill abm-video-bgdt)

- Narration: VieNeu-TTS MCP, voice {{VOICE}}. This replaces the faceless-explainer HeyGen/Kokoro TTS step.
- Captions: karaoke in the bottom 15% (a 162 px band). Each sentence shows whole and its words reveal one by one with the voice (tools/build-karaoke.mjs).
- Visuals, effects, keyframes and key text change often, land on the spoken keyword, and look novel.
- Overlay: a progress bar, a chapter label, and the courier-trail motif at each chapter start (tools/build-overlay.mjs).

## Notes

- Music: none. No logo, unless the user asks for one.
- Hard user gates:
